WEBVTT

00:34:27.220 --> 00:34:30.144
What is the biggest challenge
you're facing at work right now

00:34:30.168 --> 00:34:33.326
or the thing that's, like,
on the top of your head the most?

00:34:33.350 --> 00:34:36.112
Jeff: For me personally,
it's the same thing.

00:34:36.136 --> 00:34:40.877
It's about making that effort
to get myself out in the world more,

00:34:40.901 --> 00:34:42.666
to be around other people.

00:34:42.690 --> 00:34:44.881
AG: Here, what I heard
was self-disclosure.

00:34:44.905 --> 00:34:47.401
Jeff: And I felt that
the connection was opened up

00:34:47.425 --> 00:34:50.083
or embraced when Alex took notice of that.

00:34:50.630 --> 00:34:56.030
Alex: I think what really helped
was the fact that this was an exercise

00:34:56.054 --> 00:34:59.497
and that kind of gave us
permission to act differently

00:34:59.521 --> 00:35:00.826
than we would otherwise.